From 132521ccd39d908df2a9c40a2609a978b1875512 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Aidan <aidanjude2016@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 18:30:39 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] hazwaste: free county hazardous-waste license renewal at
 /hazwaste/

Find your shop (24,214 metro small generators from the Hennepin licence
layer, EPA ECHO and MPCA), tick what you throw out, sign; we fill in the
renewal, email it back with the county's steps, store the filing and alert
us. County submission is wired but off: a county must be marked 'submit'
and HAZWASTE_AUTOSUBMIT=1 set before anything is sent in a shop's name.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
